*  SYSTEM_driver - exercises SYSTEM(): which of the various SNOBOL4
*  processors it is running under.  Contract per system.inc header.
*  SCRIP follows Spitbol semantics, so it is expected to answer as the
*  Spitbol oracle answers; any other reply is a divergence, not a variant.
-INCLUDE "system.inc"
        OUTPUT  =  SYSTEM()
END
